# Bug hunt round 1 (trains): he gets off a moving train with sneak, as a player would, in survival.
stream on
train at station
survival on
ride nearest train
tick 30
print train
hold sneak 0.1
tick 0.05
print player
expect riding == 0
expect player.inblock == 0  # not left inside the coach's walls or the ground
tick 3
print player
expect player.health >= 18  # stepping off at train speed is no long fall
expect player.y > -40
